Package: shinychatbot
Title: Shiny Chat Bot with LLM Integration
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Author", "Name", email = "author@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny dashboard application that provides a chat interface 
    for interacting with Large Language Models (LLMs) using the ellmer package.
    Features include system prompt customization, chat history management,
    and the ability to fork conversations at any point.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
